fix: resolve cart merge race condition on login
chore: add Zod env validation to backend startup
refactor: extract shared types into shared workspace
docs: document JWT refresh rotation AI-gap in README

## ENVIRONMENT FILES
- Always keep .env.example up to date with every new env var
- Never commit real .env files
- Backend reads from backend/.env, frontend reads VITE_* vars from frontend/.env
- Root .env.example documents all vars from all packages
